problems.problem:
At the beginning there is a circle with three points on it, colored (clockwise) green, blue, red. Jonathan may perform the following actions, as many times as he wants, in any order:

• choose two adjacent points with different colors, and add a point between them having one of these two colors;

• choose two adjacent points with the same color, and add a point between them with any of the three colors;

• choose three adjacent points, at least two of which have the same color, and delete the middle one.

Can Jonathan reach a state in which only three points remain on the circle, colored (clockwise) blue, green, red?
